  "description": "Orchard Core module that provides a cross-tenant admin UI for managing feature flags\n      across all running tenants from a single page. Loads and saves settings in parallel\n      with capped concurrency, isolates per-tenant errors, and auto-enables GovBuilt.FeatureFlags\n      on any tenant where a flag is turned on.",
